{"repositoryId":922437272,"availability":"available","full":"nadimtuhin/devutils","name":"devutils","description":"DevUtils is a collection of essential developer utilities that work entirely in your browser. No data leaves your computer - everything works offline!","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":3,"created":"2025-01-26T07:45:31Z","updated":"2026-10-14T16:40:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://devutils-one.vercel.app","topics":["browser-tools","developer-tools","devtools","offline","privacy","react","tailwindcss","typescript","utilities","vite"],"demo":"https://devutils-one.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.157Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.157Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.157Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.157Z","stars":14,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your data stays in your tab. Paste a token, a query or a config, and nothing leaves your browser.","Online formatters and decoders want you to paste real data into someone else's server. DevUtils does the work in your browser, so a JWT, a SQL query or a certificate never gets uploaded.","2. Pick a tool from the list and paste your text into it. You get the formatted, decoded or converted result right on the page."],"features":["Privacy-first: No data ever leaves your browser. Every operation runs locally.","Keeps working offline while the tab is open: once the page has loaded, tools need no connection. There is no service worker, so a fresh visit needs the network.","33 tools: Formatters, converters, encoders, decoders, and more in one place.","Free & open source: MIT licensed, community-driven, no paywalls."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nadimtuhin/devutils/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4caba1c961933ff1b3128920faa2331266ab8f85a6d96008e98f09d964f330e2","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T03:00:32.287Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"20